# Ignore dev/ contents rather than the directory itself -- git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, and the two security
# docs below must be re-includable: vignette("safety") points readers at them
# for the full threat model, so they have to exist in the public repo. They
# stay out of the CRAN tarball via .Rbuildignore's ^dev$ entry.
dev/*
!dev/security_model.Rmd
!dev/hardening.Rmd
!dev/data_governance.Rmd
CLAUDE.md
